D70C 2406             (    forth6809.asm):04075                     BHS   PVDONE
D70E EC02             (    forth6809.asm):04076                     LDD   2,X
D710 ED81             (    forth6809.asm):04077                     STD   ,X++
D712 20F6             (    forth6809.asm):04078                     BRA   PVLOOP
