D715 9E49             (    forth6809.asm):04086         ALSOW:      LDX   ORDEND
D717 8C004B           (    forth6809.asm):04087                     CMPX  #ORDER
D71A 23B3             (    forth6809.asm):04088                     BLS   DFUNDER
